<div class="wrap">

  <div class="masthead">
    <h1>Website Downloader</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Mirror a site to a folder you can browse offline, assets included.</p>
  </div>

  <form class="download-form" id="downloadForm">
    <input type="text" id="website" placeholder="example.com" autocomplete="off"
           spellcheck="false" aria-label="Website address">
    <button type="button" id="download">Download</button>
  </form>
  <p class="hint">Stylesheets, scripts, images and fonts are picked up too, including
    the ones served from a CDN. Large sites can take several minutes.</p>

  <label class="opt">
    <input type="checkbox" id="includeTrackers">
    <span>
      <span class="opt-title">Include third-party trackers</span>
      <span class="opt-note">Analytics, ad pixels, consent banners and chat widgets. They do
        nothing in an offline copy, so they are left out by default. Turn this on if you are
        moving the site somewhere else and need everything. Either way the archive lists
        every third-party host in <code>THIRD-PARTY.txt</code>.</span>
    </span>
  </label>

  <div class="work" id="work" hidden>
    <div class="work-head">
      <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span id="workLabel">Starting&hellip;</span>
    </div>

    <div class="bar" id="bar"><span class="bar-fill" id="barFill"></span></div>

    <div class="metrics">
      <div class="metric" id="mPagesWrap" hidden>
        <span class="metric-k">Pages</span>
        <span class="metric-v" id="mPages">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="metric-k">Files</span>
        <span class="metric-v" id="mFiles">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="metric-k">Downloaded</span>
        <span class="metric-v" id="mBytes">0 MB</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <span class="metric-k">Elapsed</span>
        <span class="metric-v" id="mElapsed">0:00</span>
      </div>
      <div class="metric" id="mSpeedWrap" hidden>
        <span class="metric-k">Speed</span>
        <span class="metric-v" id="mSpeed">&mdash;</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="current" id="current" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="msg msg-error" id="errorBox" hidden role="alert"></div>
  <div class="msg msg-warning" id="warnBox" hidden></div>

  <div class="msg msg-ok" id="okBox" hidden>
    <p id="okText">Archive ready.</p>
    <button type="button" id="downloadWebsite">Save the zip</button>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    <p>Runs on your machine. Nothing is uploaded anywhere.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/Gabriel-Dalton/Website-downloader">Source and setup guide</a></p>
  </div>

</div>
